sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant C as Android / client
  participant F as FarmPi API
  participant S as Semantic interpreter
  participant D as Deterministic application + MariaDB
  participant Q as Qwen
  participant P as Provenance / sources

  U->>C: speak or type question
  C->>F: question + speech alternatives + preferences + conversation id
  F->>F: normalise speech/domain wording
  F->>F: deterministic fast route

  alt clear application intent or capability boundary
    F->>D: validated approved operation
  else language genuinely unclear
    F->>S: constrained interpretation request
    S-->>F: structured candidate intent
    F->>F: validate measurement / location / operation / window
    F->>D: approved deterministic operation
  end

  D-->>F: exact fact / calculation / chart / unavailable state

  opt explanation or broader information is useful
    F->>P: select reviewed context + provenance labels
    F->>Q: validated facts / source context / uncertainty
    Q-->>F: explanation / paraphrase
  end

  F-->>C: answer + source/provenance + chart/evidence + diagnostics
